!insertmacro AppEn appDoneOlder "${APP_NAME} ${VERSION} is installed"
!insertmacro AppEn appDoneWhere "You’ll find it in the Start menu."
!insertmacro AppEn appDoneWhereDesktop "You’ll find it in the Start menu and on your desktop."
